本许可适用于本项目有权授权的原创代码、文档、角色与世界观的具体表达、设定、
故事、卡牌/遗物/药水文案、翻译、原画、图标、贴图、动画、特效及其他原创内容。
第三方内容遵守其自身许可证，见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。本许可不缩减第三方
已有许可、法定例外或公共领域权利，不主张对不受保护的元素、抽象思想或游戏
机制本身享有排他权，不授予 Mega Crit 游戏、资源、商标或其他第三方知识产权。

This license covers project-owned code, documentation, setting/story expression,
text, translations, art and other original content. Third-party licenses remain
independent. No rights are claimed over public-domain or unprotectable material,
abstract ideas or game mechanics; statutory exceptions remain unaffected.

2. 有限许可 / Limited permission

允许免费下载官方发行版并供个人非商业游玩、备份及阅读。对作者公开的源码，
允许个人非商业研究、调试及本地编译；允许按 GitHub 适用条款使用其查看与 Fork
功能。为个人研究进行的本地调试不代表获准发布改编版本。公开可见或 Fork 不
授予自由改编、再发布、商用或重新许可权。本项目不宣称采用开源许可。

You may download official releases for free personal, non-commercial gameplay,
backup and reading. Published source may be studied, debugged and built locally
for personal, non-commercial use. Ordinary GitHub viewing/forking is permitted
under its applicable terms. No distribution of adaptations or commercial use
is granted. This is a restrictive source-available license, not open source.

