除上述有限许可及依法独立享有的权利外，未经相关权利人事先书面许可，不得
改编、翻译后分发、移植、重制、重混、重新打包、再发布、再许可，或拆取复用
原创设定、文案、美术等内容用于其他模组、游戏、产品或衍生作品；不得商用或
二次盈利，包括售卖、收费整合包、付费解锁、广告下载门槛、周边及转售授权。
免费改编或再发布同样需要许可。保留作者及许可声明，不得冒称原创或官方背书。

Prior written permission is required for adaptation, redistribution, translation
for distribution, ports, remixes, repackaging, sublicensing, extraction/reuse or
derivative works beyond section 2. Commercial use and secondary monetization,
including sales, paid bundles/access, ad-gated downloads, merchandise and resale
of licenses, are not authorized. Free redistribution also requires permission.
Preserve notices and do not misrepresent authorship or endorsement.

4. Mega Crit 政策优先 / Mega Crit policy comes first

涉及 Slay the Spire 2 的使用首先须遵守 Mega Crit 的适用 Content Policy、游戏
条款及平台规则：https://megacrit.com/content-policy/
官方允许对模组工作的捐赠，但禁止其他模组盈利，包括内容付费墙及众筹达标解锁。
作者的许可不能豁免官方禁止事项。捐赠不得成为获取模组内容或提前访问的对价。
本许可不允许第三方以本项目名义收款或将原创内容用于二次盈利；官方对视频与
周边的单独许可也不是复用本项目原创资产的通用商业授权。

Activity involving the game must comply with Mega Crit's applicable policy and
platform terms. Its mod policy permits donations but otherwise prohibits mod
monetization, including paywalls and stretch-goal fundraising. Project permission
cannot waive those restrictions. No third party is authorized to collect funds
in this project's name or monetize its original content. Separate video/merchandise
permissions are not a blanket license to reuse this project's original assets.

5. 第三方例外 / Third-party exceptions

BaseLib、RitsuLib、Alchyr 模板及其他可识别上游部分继续遵守其原有许可，包括
适用的 MIT 权利。本项目限制不能施加于可独立复用的上游 MIT 部分。按上游要求
保留版权及许可全文。本项目新增的原创部分则适用本许可。

Identified upstream portions retain their licenses, including MIT. Restrictions
here do not override independently reusable upstream MIT portions. Preserve their
copyright and permission notices. Project-authored additions follow this license.

